[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m to the strictly stronger requirement: for each of E1–E11 the two `.so`s must
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    60[0m:[38;5;10m[49m return the **identical `int`**. Rows E1, E2 and E11 are unrepresentable /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    61[0m:[38;5;10m[49m unreachable and are discharged by the signature and the source itself (documented
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    62[0m:[38;5;10m[49m above) rather than by a call; every other row has an executable differential
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    63[0m:[38;5;10m[49m test in `translation/tests/differential.rs`.
